# Agent and worker logs stay out of git (2026-10-21, docs/LICENSING_AUDIT.md §6): they quote whatever the worker
# grepped, wiki lines included. Already-tracked logs stay tracked until the public-export decision.
*.codex.log
worker-logs/
experiments/**/*.log
